# Copy to .env.local for local work. On Vercel, set these under
# Settings -> Environment Variables, then redeploy.
#
# Rules:
# - List every variable the site reads here, with NO values.
# - Never commit real values. .env* is git-ignored; this file is the exception
#   (.gitignore must contain `!.env.example`).
# - Never use the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix for a secret: it ships to every visitor's
#   browser.
#
# No variables are required yet. Add them below as the site needs them, e.g.:
# SOME_API_KEY=
